@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g1-first-schedule`

-- g1-interpretation.l4: Chapter 1 of the Regulation of Engagement in Work on Refrigeration or Air-Conditioning
-- Systems Law 5785-2025 (Sefer HaChukim 3349 p. 182), s.1 (purpose) and s.2 (definitions).  Group G1.
-- Imports prelude, daydate, domain and (this group's own) g1-first-schedule, for the activity enumeration that
-- the definition of "work on a cooling system" points at.  The Hebrew is copied by script from inputs/law.wiki
-- (src:N is line N); identifiers and glosses are mine and the Hebrew governs.
--
-- A definition that is a pointer ("the Registrar: the person appointed under section 19") is encoded as a
-- predicate over the one fact the pointer names; the appointment itself is another group's rule (G4).  A
-- definition that names another statute is carried as text and its effect is an input elsewhere (out-of-scope
-- rows of the coverage table).

§ `Chapter 1: Purpose and definitions`

§§ `s.1 Purpose`

-- The purpose clause conditions no outcome and imposes no duty or power: it is carried as text.  It is the
-- statement of the spirit against which a loophole assertion can be written.  A string is never a gate.
-- src:38 | {{ח:ת}} מטרתו של חוק זה להסדיר את העיסוק בעבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר, כדי להבטיח רמה מקצועית הולמת של העוסקים בכך, לשם הגנה על בטיחותם ועל בטיחות הציבור והגנה על הסביבה.
@ref s.1 (src:38)
GIVETH A STRING
`s 1 — the purpose of the Law` MEANS "to regulate engagement in work on a cooling or air-conditioning system, in order to ensure a suitable professional level of those engaged in it, for the sake of their safety and the safety of the public and the protection of the environment"

§§ `s.2 Definitions`

-- Four definitions name another statute or its register (src:44, 45, 46, 51): they are out of scope, and they are
-- carried as text in the last section of this module.

-- Lead-in and the first definition: "the Training Division".
-- src:41 | {{ח:ת}} בחוק זה –
-- src:42 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”אגף להכשרה מקצועית“ – אגף להכשרה מקצועית ולפיתוח כוח אדם האחראי למתן תעודות מקצוע כמשמעותן {{ח:חיצוני|חוק שירות התעסוקה#פרק 3|בפרק שלישי לחוק שירות התעסוקה, התשי״ט–1959}};
@ref s.2 lead-in and definition "the Training Division" (src:41-42)
@desc The facts about a division of the administration that decide whether it is the Training Division of s.2
DECLARE `Facts about a division under section 2` HAS
    `a division for vocational training and manpower development` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the division is a division for vocational training and for the development of manpower
    `responsible for granting trade certificates as meant in Chapter 3 of the Employment Service Law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the division is the one responsible for granting trade certificates as that Chapter means them

@ref s.2 definition "the Training Division" (src:42)
GIVEN division IS A `Facts about a division under section 2`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the division is the Training Division` division MEANS
        division's `a division for vocational training and manpower development`
    AND division's `responsible for granting trade certificates as meant in Chapter 3 of the Employment Service Law`

-- "licensee" (src:43): the holder of a licence for work on a cooling system.  The licence kinds the person holds
-- and that are in force on the day are an input (IP1: the licence is in force on a day, which G2 decides with s.10).
-- src:43 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”בעל רישיון“ – בעל רישיון לבצע עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר לפי הוראות חוק זה;
@ref s.2 definition "licensee" (src:43)
GIVEN `licence kinds in force on the day` IS A LIST OF `Licence kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the person is a licensee` `licence kinds in force on the day` MEANS
    NOT null `licence kinds in force on the day`

-- "the Council", "the Registrar", "the Minister", "the Ministry": each definition points at the rule that makes the
-- office.  The predicate asks the one fact the pointer names.
-- src:47 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”המועצה“ – המועצה המייעצת שמונתה לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 20|סעיף 20}};
@ref s.2 definition "the Council" (src:47)
GIVEN `appointed by the Minister as the advisory council under section 20` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the body is the Council` `appointed by the Minister as the advisory council under section 20` MEANS
    `appointed by the Minister as the advisory council under section 20`

-- src:62 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”הרשם“ – מי שמונה לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 19|סעיף 19}};
@ref s.2 definition "the Registrar" (src:62)
GIVEN `appointed by the Minister under section 19` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the person is the Registrar` `appointed by the Minister under section 19` MEANS
    `appointed by the Minister under section 19`

-- src:66 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”השר“ – שר העבודה.
@ref s.2 definition "the Minister" (src:66)
GIVEN `holds the office of Minister of Labour` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the person is the Minister` `holds the office of Minister of Labour` MEANS
    `holds the office of Minister of Labour`

-- "the Ministry" (src:52) is the Ministry of Labour.  No rule turns on which ministry it is: it is the party `the
-- Ministry` of domain.l4, and the employer in the definitions of inspector and Commissioner.  Inert; carried as text.
-- src:52 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”המשרד“ – משרד העבודה;
@ref s.2 definition "the Ministry" (src:52)
GIVETH A STRING
`s 2 — the Ministry` MEANS "the Ministry of Labour"

-- "inspector" (src:49) and "the senior inspector" (src:50): a Ministry employee the Minister authorised under
-- s.30(a); an inspector the Minister authorised as a senior inspector under s.34(a).  The authorisations are
-- G5's rules; the predicate asks the facts.
-- src:49 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מפקח“ – עובד המשרד שהשר הסמיכו לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 30|סעיף 30(א)}};
-- src:50 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”המפקח הבכיר“ – מפקח שהשר הסמיכו למפקח בכיר לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 34|סעיף 34(א)}};
@ref s.2 definitions "inspector" (src:49) and "the senior inspector" (src:50)
@desc The facts about a person that decide whether they are an inspector or the senior inspector of s.2
DECLARE `Facts about a Ministry employee under section 2` HAS
    `an employee of the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the person is an employee of the Ministry of Labour
    `authorised by the Minister under section 30(a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the Minister authorised the person as an inspector under section 30(a)
    `authorised by the Minister as a senior inspector under section 34(a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the Minister authorised the inspector as a senior inspector under section 34(a)

@ref s.2 definition "inspector" (src:49)
GIVEN person IS A `Facts about a Ministry employee under section 2`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the person is an inspector` person MEANS
        person's `an employee of the Ministry`
    AND person's `authorised by the Minister under section 30(a)`

@ref s.2 definition "the senior inspector" (src:50)
GIVEN person IS A `Facts about a Ministry employee under section 2`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the person is the senior inspector` person MEANS
        `s 2 — the person is an inspector` person
    AND person's `authorised by the Minister as a senior inspector under section 34(a)`

-- "cooling system" or "system" (src:48), and "refrigerant" (src:54).  The definition of the cooling system reads
-- the refrigerant: a system removes heat by means of one.
-- src:54 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”קרר“ (refrigerant) – גז או נוזל המאפשר הרחקת חום;
@ref s.2 definition "refrigerant" (src:54)
@desc The facts about a substance that decide whether it is a refrigerant of s.2
DECLARE `Facts about a substance under section 2` HAS
    `a gas or a liquid` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the substance is a gas or a liquid
    `enables the removal of heat` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the substance enables the removal of heat

@ref s.2 definition "refrigerant" (src:54)
GIVEN substance IS A `Facts about a substance under section 2`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the substance is a refrigerant` substance MEANS
        substance's `a gas or a liquid`
    AND substance's `enables the removal of heat`

-- src:48 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר“, ”מערכת“ – מערכת, מיתקן או מוצר, שייעודם הרחקת חום אל מחוץ לחומר או לחלל נתון, באמצעות קרר;
@ref s.2 definition "cooling system" (src:48)
@desc The facts about a thing that decide whether it is a refrigeration or air-conditioning system of s.2
DECLARE `Facts about a thing offered as a cooling system under section 2` HAS
    `a system, an installation or a product` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the thing is a system, installation or product
    `its purpose is to remove heat to the outside of a given substance or space` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if its purpose is to remove heat to the outside of a given substance or space
    `heat is removed by means of a refrigerant` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the heat is removed by means of a refrigerant

@ref s.2 definition "cooling system" (src:48)
GIVEN thing IS A `Facts about a thing offered as a cooling system under section 2`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the thing is a cooling system` thing MEANS
        thing's `a system, an installation or a product`
    AND thing's `its purpose is to remove heat to the outside of a given substance or space`
    AND thing's `heat is removed by means of a refrigerant`

-- "work on a cooling system" (src:53): performing an act on a cooling system of a kind the First Schedule lists.
-- Whether a given act amounts to one of the listed activities is a classification the caller supplies; NOTHING
-- is the act that amounts to none of them.  Three items carry a limit ("only"), which the facts decide.
-- src:53 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר“ – ביצוע פעולה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר שהיא מסוג הפעולות הקבועות {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1|בתוספת הראשונה}};
@ref s.2 definition "work on a cooling system" (src:53)
GIVEN `the activity the act amounts to` IS A MAYBE `First Schedule activity`
      limits IS A `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` `the activity the act amounts to` limits MEANS
    CONSIDER `the activity the act amounts to`
    WHEN NOTHING  THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST activity THEN `the act stays within the limits of the First Schedule item` activity limits

-- "licence" (src:55 to 58): any one of three kinds, for work on a cooling system.
-- src:55 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”רישיון“ – כל אחד מסוגי הרישיונות שלהלן, לביצוע עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר:
-- src:56 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} רישיון דרגה 1;
-- src:57 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} רישיון דרגה 2;
-- src:58 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} רישיון דרגה 3;
@ref s.2 definition "licence" (src:55-58)
GIVETH A LIST OF `Licence kind`
`s 2 — the kinds of licence` MEANS
    LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`

-- "grade 1 licence", "grade 2 licence", "grade 3 licence" (src:59 to 61): a licence for work on a cooling system
-- whose cooling capacity is up to 18 kW, up to 70 kW, and any cooling system.  "Up to" includes the limit: a
-- system of exactly 18 kW is covered by grade 1, one of exactly 70 kW by grade 2.  Two things say so: the ordinary
-- sense of "up to", and s.9(a)(1), which speaks of the systems "over 70 kW" as the ones a foreign expert may be
-- licensed for, so that 70 kW itself is not "over" and is a grade 2 system.  IL s.8 settles "until" for time and
-- quotations only, so it does not settle a capacity.  The reading where the limit is outside is callable below.
-- A capacity that is not above zero is not a capacity: nothing is returned for it where a limit is read (grade 1
-- and grade 2), and nothing is computed for grade 3, which reads no limit.
@ref s.2 definitions "grade 1 licence" (src:59) and "grade 2 licence" (src:60)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`a cooling capacity that is not above zero cannot be matched to a licence kind` MEANS
    REFUSE "a cooling capacity that is not above zero cannot be matched to a licence kind"

-- src:59 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”רישיון דרגה 1“ – רישיון לביצוע עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר שתפוקת הקירור שלה עד 18 קילו־ואט;
-- src:60 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”רישיון דרגה 2“ – רישיון לביצוע עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר שתפוקת הקירור שלה עד 70 קילו־ואט;
-- src:61 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”רישיון דרגה 3“ – רישיון לביצוע עבודה בכל מערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר;
@ref s.2 definitions "grade 1 licence" (src:59), "grade 2 licence" (src:60), "grade 3 licence" (src:61)
GIVEN kind IS A `Licence kind`
      system IS A `Cooling system`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` kind system MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `grade 1 licence` THEN
        IF   system's `cooling capacity in kilowatts` AT MOST 0
        THEN `a cooling capacity that is not above zero cannot be matched to a licence kind`
        ELSE system's `cooling capacity in kilowatts` AT MOST 18
    WHEN `grade 2 licence` THEN
        IF   system's `cooling capacity in kilowatts` AT MOST 0
        THEN `a cooling capacity that is not above zero cannot be matched to a licence kind`
        ELSE system's `cooling capacity in kilowatts` AT MOST 70
    WHEN `grade 3 licence` THEN TRUE

-- The same two limits read as exclusive ("up to" stops short of the limit): grade 1 below 18 kW, grade 2 below 70 kW.
@ref s.2 definitions "grade 1 licence" (src:59), "grade 2 licence" (src:60), "grade 3 licence" (src:61)
GIVEN kind IS A `Licence kind`
      system IS A `Cooling system`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system, "up to" read as excluding the limit` kind system MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `grade 1 licence` THEN
        IF   system's `cooling capacity in kilowatts` AT MOST 0
        THEN `a cooling capacity that is not above zero cannot be matched to a licence kind`
        ELSE system's `cooling capacity in kilowatts` LESS THAN 18
    WHEN `grade 2 licence` THEN
        IF   system's `cooling capacity in kilowatts` AT MOST 0
        THEN `a cooling capacity that is not above zero cannot be matched to a licence kind`
        ELSE system's `cooling capacity in kilowatts` LESS THAN 70
    WHEN `grade 3 licence` THEN TRUE

@ref s.2 definitions "grade 1 licence" (src:59), "grade 2 licence" (src:60), "grade 3 licence" (src:61)
@export The licence kinds that cover a refrigeration or air-conditioning system of the given cooling capacity: grade 1 up to 18 kW, grade 2 up to 70 kW, grade 3 any system; the limits are included; a capacity that is not above zero is refused
GIVEN system IS A `Cooling system` @desc The system worked on; only its cooling capacity in kilowatts is read here
GIVETH A LIST OF `Licence kind`
`licence kinds that cover a cooling system` system MEANS
    filter (GIVEN kind YIELD `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` kind system) `s 2 — the kinds of licence`

@ref s.2 definitions "grade 1 licence" (src:59), "grade 2 licence" (src:60), "grade 3 licence" (src:61)
GIVEN system IS A `Cooling system`
GIVETH A LIST OF `Licence kind`
`licence kinds that cover a cooling system, "up to" read as excluding the limit` system MEANS
    filter (GIVEN kind YIELD `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system, "up to" read as excluding the limit` kind system) `s 2 — the kinds of licence`

-- "final certificate" (src:63 to 65): one of two certificates.  (1) A certificate the Training Division issued
-- that evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning and a passed exam the Division
-- held, comprising a theoretical exam and a practical exam.  (2) A certificate the Ministry of Education issued
-- that evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream.
-- src:63 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”תעודת גמר“ – אחת מאלה:
-- src:64 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} תעודה שהנפיק האגף להכשרה מקצועית המעידה על סיום לימודי קירור ומיזוג אוויר ומעבר בהצלחה של בחינה שערך האגף להכשרה מקצועית, הכוללת בחינה עיונית ובחינה מעשית;
-- src:65 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} תעודה שהנפיק משרד החינוך המעידה על סיום בהצלחה של לימודים במגמת בקרת אקלים;
@ref s.2 definition "final certificate" (src:63-65)
@desc The facts about a certificate that decide whether it is a final certificate of s.2; the domain Certificate says which certificate it is but not what it attests
DECLARE `Facts about a certificate under section 2` HAS
    `issued by the Training Division` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the Training Division issued the certificate
    `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if it evidences completion of refrigeration and air-conditioning studies
    `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if it evidences that the holder passed an exam the Division held
    `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the exam the Division held included a theoretical exam
    `the exam included a practical exam` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the exam the Division held included a practical exam
    `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the Ministry of Education issued the certificate
    `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if it evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream

@ref s.2 definition "final certificate" (1) (src:64)
GIVEN certificate IS A `Facts about a certificate under section 2`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate under paragraph (1)` certificate MEANS
        certificate's `issued by the Training Division`
    AND certificate's `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning`
    AND certificate's `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division`
    AND certificate's `the exam included a theoretical exam`
    AND certificate's `the exam included a practical exam`

@ref s.2 definition "final certificate" (2) (src:65)
GIVEN certificate IS A `Facts about a certificate under section 2`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate under paragraph (2)` certificate MEANS
        certificate's `issued by the Ministry of Education`
    AND certificate's `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream`

@ref s.2 definition "final certificate" (src:63-65)
@export True if the certificate is a "final certificate" of section 2: a Training Division certificate of completed refrigeration and air-conditioning studies and a passed exam with a theoretical and a practical part, or a Ministry of Education certificate of completed studies in the climate-control stream
GIVEN certificate IS A `Facts about a certificate under section 2` @desc What the certificate says about its issuer, the studies and the exam
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` certificate MEANS
        `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate under paragraph (1)` certificate
    OR  `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate under paragraph (2)` certificate

-- The Second Schedule calls each certificate of its vocabulary a "final certificate" (its column A: "a final
-- certificate in refrigeration and air-conditioning studies of grade 1 from the Training Division", "a final
-- certificate evidencing climate-control studies at 3 study units from the Ministry of Education", the youth
-- vocational school's certificate, and so on).  This function states that wording for the domain vocabulary; it
-- does not test the facts of s.2(1), which `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` does.
@ref s.2 definition "final certificate" (src:63-65)
GIVEN certificate IS A Certificate
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Second Schedule calls the certificate a final certificate` certificate MEANS
    CONSIDER certificate
    WHEN `a Training Division certificate of grade 1` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a Training Division certificate of grade 2` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a Training Division certificate of grade 3` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a Training Division certificate with no grade stated` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a certificate of the Training Division vocational school for youth` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate of 3 study units` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate of 5 study units` THEN TRUE

§§ `s.2 Definitions that name another statute (out of scope)`

-- The text of the Engineers and Technicians Law, the Electricity Law, the Penal Law and the register of
-- certified technicians and practical engineers is not encoded.  What each decides enters as an input fact:
--   "the Engineers and Technicians Law" (src:44): who is registered as a technician or practical engineer is a
--       boolean on the domain Applicant (Second Schedule, G2).
--   "the Electricity Law" (src:45): ss.58 and 61 of this Law say what this Law adds to it (G7).
--   "the Penal Law" (src:46): offences enter as the domain Record of offences.
--   "the register of certified technicians and practical engineers" (src:51): kept by another body; whether the
--       applicant is registered is a boolean on the domain Applicant (s.6(a)(4)(b), G2).
-- src:44 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”חוק ההנדסאים והטכנאים המוסמכים“ – {{ח:חיצוני|חוק ההנדסאים והטכנאים המוסמכים|חוק ההנדסאים והטכנאים המוסמכים, התשע״ג–2012}};
-- src:45 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”חוק החשמל“ – {{ח:חיצוני|חוק החשמל|חוק החשמל, התשי״ד–1954}};
-- src:46 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”חוק העונשין“ – {{ח:חיצוני|חוק העונשין|חוק העונשין, התשל״ז–1977}};
-- src:51 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מרשם ההנדסאים והטכנאים המוסמכים“ – כמשמעותו {{ח:חיצוני|חוק ההנדסאים והטכנאים המוסמכים#סעיף 17|בסעיף 17 לחוק ההנדסאים והטכנאים המוסמכים}};
